infographic chart-bar-plain-text
data
  title SeverityNumber ladder: text levels mapped to a numeric scale
  desc Each level owns a band of 4; backends query the number, not the label
  values
    - label TRACE (1-4)
      value 4
    - label DEBUG (5-8)
      value 8
    - label INFO (9-12)
      value 12
    - label WARN (13-16)
      value 16
    - label ERROR (17-20)
      value 20
    - label FATAL (21-24)
      value 24
theme
